sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pres as Presenter
    participant HMI
    participant Eng as Simulation engine
    participant Plant as Virtual plant
    Pres->>HMI: Clear all faults
    HMI->>Eng: Clear command
    Eng->>Plant: Remove fault
    Plant-->>Eng: Power recovers
    Eng-->>HMI: State returns to NORMAL
